                       "spin_up": 100,
                       "why": "the game runs the record (node cmd 50 on outputs 4/5, PAD-965) 15 ms before each MAGNET-RECORD burst and stops it 5.2 s later; core.vbs's default SpinUp 10 takes 6 s to full speed, so the ball the magnet let go of left a record that had hardly turned and dropped down the middle; at 100 it is at full speed in 0.6 s, as the burst ends"},
    "RecordMotorA1":  {"leds": [[8, 5]],  "call": "PadRecordMotor", "arg": 1, "name": "MOTOR A1 DRIVER (the record's motor)"}
